Hollywood movies? David F. Sandberg, Filmmaker and YouTuber PonySmasher:  The first one is

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:09.870
stressful party is just the time of it
that I realized coming here because you

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:13.469
know when you're making your own stuff
you can take all the time you need and

00:00:13.469 --> 00:00:17.400
like you can continue another day or
whatever so coming here was the first

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.900
time I was working on under a real
schedule and you know the first ad would

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.230
put up all these things like this okay
here's the schedule for this is this

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:29.670
enough and I was like no idea I've never
made a movie like if I was making a no

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:34.170
budget short that's plenty
but yeah then you realize how long

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:38.520
