everything and it was very stressful

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.450
just because I didn't know right away
that's like if we don't get this today

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:47.100
then this scene is out of movie so I
would rush and like oh right we made it

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:53.430
right on the under the wire but then I
found out that you know if you don't get

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:58.530
it that day you can shuffle some things
around and get it another day or what we

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:02.609
did on LIGHTS OUT movie always we asked the
