00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:11.159
realized that it's more flexible than I
thought it was I thought it was very

00:01:11.159 --> 00:01:16.799
rigid like if you don't get this then
it's gone so it's it's the stressful

00:01:16.799 --> 00:01:21.990
things have been time and also sometimes
